---METADATA---
TARGET: packages/nextjs/package.json
DESCRIPTION: Add required dependencies to package.json
DEPENDENCIES: none
PRIORITY: high
---END_METADATA---

Update the package.json file to include the required dependencies for the Roast My Wallet app.

Requirements:
Add these dependencies to the "dependencies" section:
- @anthropic-ai/sdk: "^0.27.0" (or latest)
- html2canvas: "^1.4.1" (or latest)

Do NOT remove any existing dependencies.
Maintain proper JSON formatting.
Keep the file structure intact.

After updating, the user should run:
```bash
cd packages/nextjs
yarn install
```

Note: If these packages already exist, ensure versions are up to date.
